mission "The King's Unwritten Order"
    name "The King's Unwritten Order"
    description "Recover the missing page from an old monastery register before the governor's agents arrive."
    source "Mariner's Rest"
    destination "San Aurelio"
    reward 1460
    speaker offer "Brother Mateo"
    speaker visit "Brother Mateo"
    speaker complete "Brother Mateo"
    to offer
        has "A Debt in the Admiralty: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Brother Mateo has opened the monastery register to a page where the binding has been cut. The missing leaf was removed carefully, not torn out by accident.`
            `Mateo runs a finger along the cut binding. "The governor's agents are on their way. I need that page before they arrive; it is the one part of the register that records the expedition's order."`
            choice
                `"Very well. I will take responsibility for the next leg."`
                    accept
                `"Tell me the part you have not put on the table."`
                    goto details
                `"I will not be drawn into it. Good day."`
                    close
            label details
                `He closes the book before anyone can see the gap. "Do not let them know you are looking for it. Find the page and bring it back without giving them a reason to search the rest of the house."`
                choice
                    `"Then let us stop talking and set sail."`
                        accept
                    `"Not for me. Let another captain take the work."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The King's Unwritten Order. Recover the missing page from an old monastery register before the governor's agents arrive."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At San Aurelio, Mateo compares the recovered page with the monastery's surviving entries. "The expedition was given a sealed order," he says. "The register names the authority behind it, but not the destination."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Mateo returns the page to the register and closes the cover. "A record should not be kept in a drawer where a governor's man can take it away. I will keep it with the rest of the history, where it belongs."`
        log "Completed The King's Unwritten Order. Received 1460 gold. Recover the missing page from an old monastery register before the governor's agents arrive."
